      <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Traffic shaping used by Snell v6. &quot;unsafe-raw&quot; disables padding and is faster but easier to fingerprint.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
